kind":"announcement","title":"260919 Add hit animation + Bug Fix","summary":"Improved Impact FeelI’ve added special hit animations for when damage exceeds 100 and 1,000!(The animation below triggers when damage exceeds 100. See the 1,000-damage animation for yourself in-game!)Bug FixesFixed a bug where the Japanese tutorial text was displaying across three lines.Fixed an issue where the effect position was misaligned when changing the Dice.I removed the stuttering in the village description section.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T10:31:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010496941","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4022200-1843481262704724","game_id":"steam-4022200","kind":"update","title":"UI, Tutorial Update","summary":"I’ve updated the UI and tutorial.1. Added tutorial arrows.2. Improved the top inventory UI and added a toggle (enable/disable) function.3. Adjusted the position of the exit button.4. Modified the bottom skill UI.5. Consolidated the \"exit by clicking empty space\" function into the exit button.6. Added an auto-place button for dice.7. Added connecting lines between and the .I expect to announce the release date soon!Thank you so much for your patience :)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T14:20:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262704724","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4022200-1839676055890047","game_id":"steam-4022200","kind":"update","title":"Demo 3 Chapter Update!(Last Chapter in Demo)","summary":"Hello, I’m SinPoDo, the developer of Destiny Is Dice!As promised, I’m back with the Chapter 3 update!Based on the game tests, it seems we made the right decision to release up to Chapter 3, which is a major turning point :)I’ll do our best to aim for a release in the fourth quarter of 2026 or the first quarter of 2027!I hope this update helps make the wait until then a little easier :)Thank you for your continued support!Update Log(Updates included in this release)Content Updates- Chapter 3, the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-01T05:33:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055890047","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4022200-1837955055362223","game_id":"steam-4022200","kind":"announcement","title":"3-Chapter comming!","summary":"I have currently finished working on Chapter 3.Pre-testing and feedback collection (via Stove - Indie Boost Lab) are currently underway, and the update is scheduled to launch on Steam sometime in August!The planned update details are listed below, though additional content may be included.Story ContentAddition of Chapter 3 story (final story update for the demo)Minor text revisions (English/Korean)Added a sequence for the start of the chapter.Quality UpdatesDialogue can now be advanced by clicki","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T02:20:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055362223","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4022200-1834602721190381","game_id":"steam-4022200","kind":"update","title":"Animation Update, etc (26.06.05)","summary":"This week, we revamped combat controls, including animations, and implemented other convenience updates!Please see below for details!26.06.05 UpdateAdded unique character animations and camera move when using character's second skill.Modified to allow attacks by interrupting the passive application animation.Simplified font size range from (1-5) to (1-3).Lowered difficulty for the Bard's Life stage.Modified speech bubble UI in Town.Added combat reward reroll function.Added 'Warning' button at th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-05T11:40:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721190381","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4022200-1833968530892780","game_id":"steam-4022200","kind":"update","title":"UI Update(26.05.03)","summary":"26.05.30 UpdateChanges to the combat start UI.Fixed a bug where the character window would not close after opening if clicked quickly during combat.Improved visibility of damage numbers during combat.Simplified item inventory system (integrated dice items and consumable items).Added a prompt to exit the game.Adjusted background brightness for Library and Town, and modified some UI elements.Added spacebar compatibility for dialogue.Added a feature to change dialogue font size.Added a dialogue pro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-30T03:31:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530892780","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4022200-1833334318571115","game_id":"steam-4022200","kind":"update","title":"Demo - Chapter 2 Update!","summary":"(06 / 10) Chapter 2 updates for the Destiny Is Dice demo are complete!Some of the content up to Chapter 2 has been implemented in the demo. The details are as follows:Content UpdatesAdded 1 stage (You can obtain 1 story boss and 3 Memory Fragments.)Added rewards for clearing Chapter 2 stagesAdded 4 new characters to the character pool upon clearing Chapter 2Added a new enhancement element, 'town' upon clearing Chapter 2Added separate boss rewardsAdded item quantity limitsConvenience UpdatesClick","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-22T09:19:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318571115","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4022200-1832700592793733","game_id":"steam-4022200","kind":"announcement","title":"Chapter 2 will be updated in the second quarter of 2026!","summary":"Work on Chapter 2 of the game is currently nearing completion!To allow you to enjoy it in advance in the demo version, I am pre-releasing a portion of the .(More items, characters, and stages will be added in the full version.)I would appreciate it if you could add this to your wishlist so I can notify you via an announcement when the update is ready :)Please leave your feedback in reviews or on Steam forums, and I will actively incorporate it.If the response is positive, I might even release Ch","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-16T04:51:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592793733","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4022200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:03:12Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:03:12Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4022200":"2026-10-26T01:03:12Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4022200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:03:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:03:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4022590":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:03:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:03:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4022200","app_id":4022200,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:26Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"7715c05aaed35e59cca68776425b50a620c66c775335350d9e26ae3b82f2e850","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"이동도, 전투도, 몇 개의 주사위로 결정되는 혼돈의 던전.\r\n그곳에 갇혀버린 당신은 이 주사위 지옥에 휘말리고 말았습니다!\r\n그런 당신이 의지할 수 있는 건, 이곳의 운명을 지배하는 마녀 ‘Grin’뿐입니다.\r\n당신의 가족이라고 자칭하는 이 마녀는, 당신을 위해서라면 기꺼이 주사위를 조작해 줄 것입니다.\r\n이를 통해 존재하지 않았던 선택지를 만들어내고, 원하는 전술을 구사하여 승기를 가져오세요!\r\n그리고 팀을 결성하고, 아이템을 모아 최강의 팀을 만들어 주세요. 언젠가는 Grin의 도움이 필요 없을 정도로 말이죠.","publishers":[{"name":"SinPoDo","creator_clan_account_id":45754313}],"developers":[{"name":"SinPoDo","creator_clan_account_id":45754313}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1801231860,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Release Date Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1790682446","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4022200/890248543/917e28e6aa7e82800993f2b4f8febd4f4c6f7cd2/1790681748/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4022200/890248543/917e28e6aa7e82800993f2b4f8febd4f4c6f7cd2/1790681748/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"4022200/890248543/917e28e6aa7e82800993f2b4f8febd4f4c6f7cd2/1790681748/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"4022200/890248543/917e28e6aa7e82800993f2b4f8febd4f4c6f7cd2/1790681748/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"4022200/890248543/917e28e6aa7e82800993f2b4f8febd4f4c6f7cd2/1790681748/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257439595/593650da9dbf0ca3e39fc665526a0520a9c4b18b/movie_600x337.jpg","screenshot_full":"257439595/593650da9dbf0ca3e39fc665526a0520a9c4b18b/movie_full.jpg","trailer_base_id":1351467,"all_ages":true},{"trailer_n